<div class="space-y-5">
  <div>
    <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">WhatsApp Marketing</h4>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Send promotional WhatsApp messages to your leads and customers. Use custom messages for individual outreach or bulk messages for mass campaigns.</p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">How to Use</h5>
    <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4">
      <li><strong>Custom Message:</strong> Click "Custom Message" under Leads or Customers to compose a personalised message to a specific recipient</li>
      <li><strong>Bulk Message:</strong> Type a message in the text area and click "Send Bulk" to send the same message to all leads or all active customers</li>
      <li><strong>Template Message:</strong> From the compose page, select an approved template to send structured messages with buttons, headers, and media</li>
      <li><strong>Message Log:</strong> Click "View All" under Recent Messages to see the full delivery log with status tracking</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Rules & Regulations</h5>
    <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4">
      <li><strong>24-hour window:</strong> Free-form messages can only be sent within 24 hours of the customer's last message. Outside this window, use an approved template.</li>
      <li><strong>Template approval:</strong> Marketing templates must be approved by Meta before they can be sent (up to 24 hours).</li>
      <li><strong>Opt-in required:</strong> Recipients must have opted in to receive marketing messages.</li>
      <li><strong>Rate limits:</strong> New accounts start with 250 business-initiated conversations per 24 hours. Increases with good quality ratings.</li>
      <li><strong>Quality rating:</strong> High block/report rates can lower your quality rating, reduce sending limits, or disable your number.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Terms & Conditions</h5>
    <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4">
      <li>Bulk messages are subject to Meta's messaging limits based on your tier</li>
      <li>Each message sent consumes one conversation credit from your WhatsApp Business account</li>
      <li>Marketing messages sent outside the 24-hour window require an approved template</li>
      <li>You are responsible for compliance with local data protection laws (GDPR, etc.)</li>
      <li>Spam or misleading content can result in account suspension by Meta</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-700 mb-2">Common Errors</h5>
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">"WhatsApp API not configured"</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1">API credentials are missing. Go to Settings and enter your Phone Number ID, Access Token, and other required fields.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">"Message failed to send"</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1">Recipient's number may be invalid, not on WhatsApp, or you may have exceeded your messaging limit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">"Template not approved"</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1">Only templates approved by Meta can be sent. Check the Templates page for status and resubmit if rejected.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">"Rate limit exceeded" (Error 130429)</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1">You've exceeded the maximum messages for your current tier. Wait and retry, or request a tier upgrade.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
